      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ORSON JIMMY (1) doesn't win out of turn. Hit the board with a minor placing last time when second (21.11) at this track. Safe beginner who draws ideally on the inside. One of the contenders. HIBIKI BLUE (6) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing seventh (21.21) in a Grade 5 at Goulburn. Should be about the mark. MELLCAT BAD BOY (8) jumped from a low draw and boxed on well to finish second last time, beaten 1.75 lengths (20.21) behind Summer Faith at Goulburn. Has a very good strike-rate from this draw, with two wins from four starts. Overdue and is among the main hopes. CAMBRIDGE KING (7) didn't go as well as expected last time but a better run is on the cards.",
